; rfg.exe imports XINPUT1_3.dll by ordinals 2 and 3 only. Every export forwards to the system DLL (core.cpp).
LIBRARY xinput1_3.dll
EXPORTS
    XInputGetState @2
    XInputSetState @3
    XInputGetCapabilities @4
    XInputEnable @5
    XInputGetDSoundAudioDeviceGuids @6
    XInputGetBatteryInformation @7
    XInputGetKeystroke @8
    XInputGetStateEx @100 NONAME
